{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/custom-plugin/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>여러 번 사용되는 라이브러리의 경우<br>\n컴포넌트마다 import 해오지 말고 plugin으로 만들어 사용하면 좋다.<br>\nplugin으로 등록하면 전역에서 사용할 수 있다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"chartjs-라이브러리-plugin-제작\" style=\"position:relative;\">Chart.js 라이브러리 plugin 제작<a href=\"#chartjs-%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%8C%EB%9F%AC%EB%A6%AC-plugin-%EC%A0%9C%EC%9E%91\" aria-label=\"chartjs 라이브러리 plugin 제작 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\">$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> i chart.js</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> ChartPlugin <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./plugins/ChartPlugin.js'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\nVue<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">use</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>ChartPlugin<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p file=\"src/index.js\"></p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">Vue.use(ChartPlugin)</code> 하게 되면 <code class=\"language-text\">ChartPlugin</code> 안의 <code class=\"language-text\">install()</code> 함수가 실행된다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> Chart<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> registerables <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'chart.js'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\nChart <span class=\"token function\">register</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">...</span>registerables<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">install</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">Vue</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">Vue</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>prototype<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>$_Chart <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Chart<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p file=\"src/plugins/ChartPlugin.js\"></p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">install()</code> 함수가 실행되면<br>\nVue.prototype에 <code class=\"language-text\">$_Chart</code>라는 이름으로 Chart가 등록된다.<br>\n변수명 앞에 <code class=\"language-text\">$_</code> 를 프리픽스로 사용하는 이유는 <strong>$와 _는 이미 Vue 내부에서 사용되고 있기 때문</strong>이다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">export default {\r\n  mounted() {\r\n    const ctx = this.$refs.BarChart;\r\n    new this._Chart(ctx, {\r\n      type: &#39;bar&#39;,\r\n      // ...\r\n    })\r\n  }\r\n}</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p file=\"src/components/component.vue\"></p>\n<p>플러그인으로 등록하면 컴포넌트에서 <code class=\"language-text\">this.$_Chart</code>로 접근이 가능하다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h5>참고</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html#plugins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vue.js</a></li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#chartjs-%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%8C%EB%9F%AC%EB%A6%AC-plugin-%EC%A0%9C%EC%9E%91\">Chart.js 라이브러리 plugin 제작</a></li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Custom Plugin","summary":"여러 번 사용되는 라이브러리의 경우 컴포넌트마다 import 해오지 말고 plugin으로 만들어 사용하면 좋다. plugin으로 등록하면 전역에서 사용할 수 있다. Chart.js 라이브러리 plugin 제작 import ChartPlugin from ./plugins/ChartPlugin.js; Vue.use(ChartPlugin);","date":"Feb 2, 2024","categories":["VUE"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/vue/custom-plugin/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/vue/vue_loading_spinner_eventbus/","title":"LoadingSpinner | EventBus"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/javascript/insertAdjacentHTML/","title":"Element